  sentences:
    nameNPC: Ta
    Lines:
    - "S\u01B0\u01A1ng b\xE1m l\u01B0ng ng\u1EF1a v\xE0 m\xE9p gi\xE1o. Tr\u1ED1ng
      ba h\u1ED3i. K\xE8n ng\u1EAFn hai ti\u1EBFng. Qu\xE2n \u0110inh d\xE0n tr\xEAn
      g\xF2 thoai tho\u1EA3i th\xE0nh ba n\u1EA5c, n\u1ECF th\u1EA5p, gi\xE1o cao,
      khi\xEAn m\xE2y x\u1EBFp n\u1EEDa \xFAp. B\xEAn kia, k\u1EF5 Ki\u1EC1u tr\xE0n
      kh\u1ECFi s\u1ED1ng \u0111\u1ED3i nh\u01B0 th\xE1c b\xF9n, \u0111\u1EA7u h\xE0ng
      c\u1EA7m lao ng\u1EAFn, sau l\u01B0ng c\u1EDD d\xE0y kh\xEDt. V\xF3 \u0111\u1EA1p
      \u0111\xE1 tung tia l\u1EEDa nh\u1ECF."
